@name: Standard user completes checkout
@tags: e2e, critical, checkout
@description: End-to-end purchase flow — login, add two items, verify cart, checkout, verify totals
@retry: 1

@use login.runly with user=standard_user pass=secret_sauce
@use add-item-to-cart.runly with item="sauce labs backpack"
@use add-item-to-cart.runly with item="sauce labs onesie"

click cart icon on the top right

verify ai: both the sauce labs backpack and the sauce labs onesie are in the cart

click checkout button

@use fill-personal-info.runly

click continue button

verify ai: the item total matches the sum of each listed item's price
verify ai: the total equals the item total plus tax

click finish button
